    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BARRY AUCTIONEERS & VALUERS are delighted to bring this beautifully maintained four-bedroom semi-detached home to the market. Presented in excellent condition throughout, this A-rated property offers spacious accommodation, modern energy efficiency and a fantastic opportunity for families looking for a home in a highly sought-after location.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is bright, spacious and well laid out, making this an ideal family home.\r\nThe location is a major attraction, with shops, schools, sporting facilities and a bus route all close by, while the nearby main road and footpaths are nearing completion. With Cork City Centre and Cork Airport just minutes away by car, this is an excellent opportunity to acquire a turn-key family home in a convenient and desirable area. Viewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property offers a private driveway with parking for two cars, along with a well-maintained rear garden, patio area, steel-tech shed and wide side access. The home also benefits from uPVC windows and doors and an air-to-water heating system, contributing to its excellent A-rated BER."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - \r\nTiled flooring, understairs storage and guest WC.\n\r\n\r\nKitchen / Sun Room - 5.29m x 5.16m \r\nA bright and spacious area featuring a fitted kitchen, tiled flooring, large window and patio doors providing access to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nUtility Room - 1.20m x 1.00m \r\nTiled flooring and plumbed for a washing machine and tumble dryer. \r\n\r\nLiving Room - 5.10m x 3.13m \r\nComfortable reception room with timber flooring, feature fireplace with wood-burning stove, and a large front-facing window with curtains.\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 5.80m x 4.15m \r\nLocated on the second floor, this exceptionally spacious bedroom benefits from a large dormer window which floods the room with natural light. Carpeted and fitted with two wardrobes. The room also features a private ensuite that is fully tiled with power shower.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.26m x 3.18m \r\nFront-facing bedroom with carpet flooring and fitted wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.81m x 2.75m \r\nRear-facing bedroom with carpet flooring and fitted wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 2.87m x 2.41m \r\nRear-facing bedroom with carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom - \r\nFully tiled from floor to ceiling and fitted with a bath and power shower.\r\n\r\nOutside - \r\n\r\n\r\nFront - \r\nPrivate driveway providing parking for two cars.\n\r\n\r\nRear Garden - \r\nWell-maintained rear garden featuring a patio area, steel-tech shed and a wide side passage providing convenient access to the front of the property.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
